type: tab-list
title: Environment Config

- Development: Local developer setup with fast feedback loops
  - Debug logging enabled for all services
  - Hot reload active via Vite and nodemon
- Staging: Production-parity environment for final validation
  - All external integrations use sandbox credentials
  - Alerts muted to avoid false-positive pages
- Production: Live traffic with full observability and strict limits
  - Full distributed tracing with 7-day retention
  - Rate limiting and circuit breakers enforced
